{
  "video_id": "wTf9xqfCJcA",
  "segment_count": 110,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 9.519,
      "duration": 8.401,
      "text": "Growing up in Singapore, I never thought"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.559,
      "duration": 8.8,
      "text": "that becoming a musician is a path."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.92,
      "duration": 6.56,
      "text": "There were many times when I feel out of"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.359,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "text": "sync with the things around me and"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.48,
      "duration": 5.68,
      "text": "sometimes I feel I lack the kind of"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.359,
      "duration": 6.071,
      "text": "normaly my friends have. my friends who"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.16,
      "duration": 8.52,
      "text": "choose a more stable path."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.43,
      "duration": 5.25,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.73,
      "duration": 3.669,
      "text": "[Applause]"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.0,
      "duration": 6.96,
      "text": ">> My song Burnout Dynasty actually"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.399,
      "duration": 6.051,
      "text": "captures my state of being growing up in"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.96,
      "duration": 4.679,
      "text": "Singapore."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.45,
      "duration": 3.189,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.64,
      "duration": 6.52,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.879,
      "duration": 7.731,
      "text": "There's always this pressure to do well,"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.16,
      "duration": 15.2,
      "text": "be excellent. It's very tiring."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.61,
      "duration": 14.11,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.36,
      "duration": 6.24,
      "text": ">> My parents are very pragmatic. Pragmatic"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.72,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "text": "Asian parents. Their biggest fear of me"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.6,
      "duration": 4.57,
      "text": "pursuing music would be the financial"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.92,
      "duration": 6.96,
      "text": "aspect of it."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.17,
      "duration": 8.07,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.88,
      "duration": 6.32,
      "text": "And I think dealing with the instability"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.24,
      "duration": 6.239,
      "text": "of how this career could go because it's"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.2,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "text": "not a linear trajectory. It's not"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.479,
      "duration": 6.121,
      "text": "directly proportionate to the kind of"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.72,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "effort you put in."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.72,
      "duration": 6.2,
      "text": "I feel like luck is such a big big big"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.92,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": "equation."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.12,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.56,
      "duration": 5.839,
      "text": ">> I learned to put less emphasis on the"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.36,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "text": "output and more on the presence in which"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.399,
      "duration": 5.121,
      "text": "I show up for my craft, which is very"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.8,
      "duration": 6.72,
      "text": "different from the society I grew up in,"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.52,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "text": "I guess, where productivity is always so"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.52,
      "duration": 4.799,
      "text": "idealize"
    },
    {
      "start": 139.04,
      "duration": 6.279,
      "text": "and your output sort of determines your"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.319,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": "selfworth."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.53,
      "duration": 6.03,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.879,
      "duration": 6.801,
      "text": ">> What helped me build this selfbelief"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.56,
      "duration": 6.959,
      "text": "was showing up for myself."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.68,
      "duration": 6.32,
      "text": "So little things like prioritizing my"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.519,
      "duration": 5.521,
      "text": "health, like getting enough rest, eating"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.0,
      "duration": 5.76,
      "text": "healthily, having a day off on tour is"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.04,
      "duration": 6.08,
      "text": "always a blessing. I would I would take"
    },
    {
      "start": 171.76,
      "duration": 5.03,
      "text": "it and just go to places that I really"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.12,
      "duration": 4.85,
      "text": "want to visit."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.79,
      "duration": 3.18,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.599,
      "duration": 7.64,
      "text": ">> And it's very grounding to know that I"
    },
    {
      "start": 185.04,
      "duration": 4.199,
      "text": "have a place to come home to."
    },
    {
      "start": 191.12,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "Hello. Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 208.64,
      "duration": 7.239,
      "text": "I feel like food is my comfort food and"
    },
    {
      "start": 211.36,
      "duration": 4.519,
      "text": "it feels like home. Feels like home."
    },
    {
      "start": 216.33,
      "duration": 4.23,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 219.04,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "text": ">> Test. Oh"
    },
    {
      "start": 222.0,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "text": ">> Mark, you're mixing my reverb up."
    },
    {
      "start": 223.76,
      "duration": 3.119,
      "text": ">> No,"
    },
    {
      "start": 224.4,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "text": ">> I guess you have to turn up 16. I'm on"
    },
    {
      "start": 226.879,
      "duration": 1.521,
      "text": "16."
    },
    {
      "start": 227.28,
      "duration": 1.76,
      "text": ">> Yeah, you're on 16."
    },
    {
      "start": 228.4,
      "duration": 2.479,
      "text": ">> Then 14."
    },
    {
      "start": 229.04,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "text": ">> The reverb is 49."
    },
    {
      "start": 230.879,
      "duration": 4.561,
      "text": ">> Along the way, I've met so many"
    },
    {
      "start": 232.4,
      "duration": 5.039,
      "text": "different creatives, people who do super"
    },
    {
      "start": 235.44,
      "duration": 4.879,
      "text": "amazing things. It's like they also grew"
    },
    {
      "start": 237.439,
      "duration": 6.241,
      "text": "up in this system and yet they could"
    },
    {
      "start": 240.319,
      "duration": 6.881,
      "text": "create something so extraordinary and I"
    },
    {
      "start": 243.68,
      "duration": 4.639,
      "text": "get very inspired by it."
    },
    {
      "start": 247.2,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "I'm good actually because"
    },
    {
      "start": 248.319,
      "duration": 5.441,
      "text": ">> we have our own story. We have our own"
    },
    {
      "start": 250.64,
      "duration": 5.68,
      "text": "culture and I think being able to create"
    },
    {
      "start": 253.76,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "text": "is very powerful because we get to"
    },
    {
      "start": 256.32,
      "duration": 6.24,
      "text": "capture the state of being in that"
    },
    {
      "start": 258.72,
      "duration": 7.6,
      "text": "environment which is very unique."
    },
    {
      "start": 262.56,
      "duration": 5.919,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 266.32,
      "duration": 2.879,
      "text": "How do you define yourself as a"
    },
    {
      "start": 268.479,
      "duration": 2.401,
      "text": "musician?"
    },
    {
      "start": 269.199,
      "duration": 4.481,
      "text": ">> I feel like even until now, I still"
    },
    {
      "start": 270.88,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "text": "don't feel certain about doing music"
    },
    {
      "start": 273.68,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "text": "forever."
    },
    {
      "start": 275.28,
      "duration": 3.359,
      "text": "But then, well, I'm still doing it. I"
    },
    {
      "start": 277.28,
      "duration": 2.56,
      "text": "just do my best."
    },
    {
      "start": 278.639,
      "duration": 3.201,
      "text": ">> May take as long as you feel like you"
    },
    {
      "start": 279.84,
      "duration": 4.079,
      "text": "still have something to say, something"
    },
    {
      "start": 281.84,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "text": "to give. Like, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 283.919,
      "duration": 4.641,
      "text": ">> You know what? I really thought like"
    },
    {
      "start": 285.84,
      "duration": 5.359,
      "text": "like we are all misfits, you know, like"
    },
    {
      "start": 288.56,
      "duration": 5.199,
      "text": "I never felt I belong anywhere else as a"
    },
    {
      "start": 291.199,
      "duration": 4.081,
      "text": "musician to be able to play freely. I"
    },
    {
      "start": 293.759,
      "duration": 3.601,
      "text": "think creatively we don't deny each"
    },
    {
      "start": 295.28,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": "other the chance to like uh no we"
    },
    {
      "start": 297.36,
      "duration": 6.52,
      "text": "encourage each other to like"
    },
    {
      "start": 299.44,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": ">> vibe off each other you know"
    },
    {
      "start": 303.96,
      "duration": 13.48,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 313.28,
      "duration": 6.639,
      "text": "I hope for a Singapore where success"
    },
    {
      "start": 317.44,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "text": "comes in many forms."
    },
    {
      "start": 319.919,
      "duration": 4.481,
      "text": "The kind of Singapore where we don't"
    },
    {
      "start": 322.4,
      "duration": 5.519,
      "text": "gauge everyone according to the same"
    },
    {
      "start": 324.4,
      "duration": 6.88,
      "text": "metrics. The kind where we acknowledge"
    },
    {
      "start": 327.919,
      "duration": 6.401,
      "text": "that everyone has different dreams and"
    },
    {
      "start": 331.28,
      "duration": 6.04,
      "text": "they are equally worthy even if they're"
    },
    {
      "start": 334.32,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": "unconventional."
    },
    {
      "start": 344.96,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "text": "Dear Singapore, you don't need to follow"
    },
    {
      "start": 347.68,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "text": "someone else's map."
    },
    {
      "start": 350.16,
      "duration": 5.61,
      "text": "You just need the courage to walk your"
    },
    {
      "start": 352.8,
      "duration": 7.879,
      "text": "own."
    },
    {
      "start": 355.77,
      "duration": 4.909,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 360.72,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": "Oh,"
    },
    {
      "start": 365.8,
      "duration": 12.399,
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 375.199,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": "hey."
    }
  ]
}